{
"#name"
:
{
"cve"
:
null
,
"en"
:
"The CVE command-line interface, powered by x-cmd, fetches CVE indexes from x-cmd/cve via curl."
,
"cn"
:
"CVE 命令行接口，由 x-cmd 驱动，通过 curl 从 x-cmd/cve 获取 CVE 索引。"
}
,
"#tip"
:
[
{
"en"
:
"- **The 4 commands you'll actually use:**\n  ```sh\n  x cve                          # browse / fzf over every cached CVE (newest first)\n  x cve info CVE-2024-0001       # look up by id (or `x cve 2024-0001`)\n  x cve detail CVE-2024-0001     # pull the FULL upstream record (affected, CWE, references, ADP)\n  x shodan cve CVE-2024-0001     # enrich with Shodan: EPSS, KEV, exploits, vendor advisories\n  ```\n  See <https://x-cmd.com/mod/cve> and <https://x-cmd.com/mod/shodan/cve>.\n- No API key, no sudo, no background services. `x cve` is a thin shell module backed by per-year xz-compressed TSVs published daily at `github.com/x-cmd/cve/releases/download/data/`.\n- **`x shodan cve` is worth the extra hop** when you need to know \"is this exploitable, who's affected, what's the patch\" — Shodan aggregates EPSS, KEV listing, exploit writeups, and vendor advisories that the upstream CVE record itself doesn't carry.\n- Cache hit on the second call onward — current year refreshes every 1 day, older years stay cached 180 days.\n- Shorthands: `x cve 2026` is `x cve year --tsv 2026`; `x cve 2026-9999` is `x cve info CVE-2026-9999`; `x cve 2026-05` is `x cve year 2026 | grep CVE-2026-05`.\n- For the full upstream record (affected products, CWE, references, timeline, ADP), use `x cve detail CVE-YYYY-NNNN`.\n"
,
"cn"
:
"- **最常用的 4 个命令：**\n  ```sh\n  x cve                          # 浏览 / fzf 所有缓存的 CVE（最新优先）\n  x cve info CVE-2024-0001       # 按 id 查询（或 `x cve 2024-0001`）\n  x cve detail CVE-2024-0001     # 拉取完整上游记录（受影响产品、CWE、参考、ADP）\n  x shodan cve CVE-2024-0001     # 用 Shodan 补充：EPSS、KEV、漏洞利用、厂商公告\n  ```\n  详见 <https://x-cmd.com/mod/cve> 与 <https://x-cmd.com/mod/shodan/cve>。\n- 无需 API key、无需 sudo、无需后台服务。`x cve` 是轻量 shell 模块，数据来自 `github.com/x-cmd/cve/releases/download/data/` 每日发布的 xz 压缩 TSV。\n- **`x shodan cve` 值得多一跳**——Shodan 聚合的 EPSS、KEV 列表、漏洞利用文章、厂商公告是上游 CVE 记录本身没有的，对于\"这个漏洞是否可利用、谁受影响、补丁是什么\"特别有用。\n- 第二次起即命中缓存：当年 1 天刷新一次，老年份 180 天不再拉取。\n- 简写：`x cve 2026` 等价于 `x cve year --tsv 2026`；`x cve 2026-9999` 等价于 `x cve info CVE-2026-9999`。\n- 查看完整上游记录（受影响产品、CWE、参考、时间线、ADP），使用 `x cve detail CVE-YYYY-NNNN`。\n"
}
]
,
"info"
:
